                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a nice little sidescrolling adventure game with a bunch of interesting SCPs to see. The price point is low so I don't think there is much to lose here, especially if you like SCP. \n\nThe game is quite short and while the graphics feel a bit cheap and the W key is a bit janky I do think that the content and gameplay make up for it. The fact that you get to play as an SCP too is a nice change of pace from many other games related to the SCP Foundation.\n\nIt's decent. If you like SCP or these types of games then I recommend this, otherwise not really.",
